%U A400543 56539106072908298546665520023773393229413360907540927111398167485297475584
%N A400543 Number of equivalence classes of Boolean functions of n variables under cyclic permutations and independent complementations of variables.
%C A400543 The acting group is C_2^n semidirect C_n, of order n*2^n.
%F A400543 a(n) = (1/n) * Sum_{d|n} phi(d) * (2^(C1(n,d)-n/d) + (2^(n/d)-1) * 2^(C2(n,d)-n/d)) where C1(n,d) = (1/d)*Sum_{r|d} phi(r)*2^(n/r) and C2(n,d) = (1/(2*d))*Sum_{r|d, r odd} phi(r)*2^(n/r).
%e A400543 For n = 3, C1(3,1) = 8, C2(3,1) = 4, C1(3,3) = 4, and C2(3,3) = 2.
%e A400543 Hence a(3) = (46 + 2*10)/3 = 22.
%Y A400543 Cf. A397652 (without complementations of variables).
%K A400543 nonn,new
%O A400543 1,1
